WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.870
Welcome to Beiqiang Footwear in Quanzhou, China.

00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:07.825
Here is a three-minute look at selected factory working areas.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:12.828
Material cutting and component preparation begin the visible workflow.

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:34.303
Prepared parts are organized before footwear upper production.

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:44.940
Operators stitch and shape footwear uppers at dedicated work stations.

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:07.594
Finished shoes are organized here for handling and order staging.

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:29.951
Workers carry out upper finishing and edge preparation around the last.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:44.895
Shoes move between work stations for component handling and pair checking.

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:09.203
Pairs are prepared with packing materials and shoe boxes.

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:16.625
Further line handling and finishing steps follow.

00:02:16.665 --> 00:02:20.401
Processes vary by shoe style and order requirements.

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:43.468
Equipment-assisted finishing completes the tour.

00:02:43.508 --> 00:02:49.343
Contact Beiqiang for a current catalog, samples, or an OEM and ODM discussion.
